  = note: an attribute nothing implements would compile and mean nothing, so it is refused by name
    ([gram.item.attr], K13); the performance contracts (I15) have no checker yet
    (wolf-lang#180), and an unchecked promise is worse than none. The attributes this
    compiler implements: `trusted`, `consttime`, `allow`, `index`, `budget`, `repr(c)` and
    `cfg(target = "…")`.
